    "updated_at": "2026-07-07T08:31:12Z",
    "body": "Actually, this is more likely a regression from huggingface's video processor refactoring, because the default fps before is 2 instead of 24, which made sure `t_factor` consistent.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/huggingface/transformers/blob/33d1d715b0260efc1c2df1c16d864186b5bb9437/src/transformers/models/qwen2_5_vl/processing_qwen2_5_vl.py#L133\r\n\r\nAnyway, thanks for fixing this!\r\n",
